When writing or changing game code, follow the project skills:

- `.cursor/skills/dry-yagni-kiss/SKILL.md` — DRY, YAGNI, KISS
- `.cursor/skills/solid-principles/SKILL.md` — SOLID mapped to scenes/scripts
- `.cursor/skills/gamedev-patterns/SKILL.md` — Godot-friendly game patterns

Read a skill before adding a new script, type, or manager. Locked rules stay in `CONTEXT.md`. English for comments, docs, and commits.
